{"kind":"propose","text":"LV5 B4 needs a product binding decision once LV4 lands. The installed LV4 presence definition is a TEST package. MCP can renew an existing declared card through view_live_act, while the empty view offers no opener. The member kit currently renders identity and standing, and the Grow package’s reviewed presence source is the recorded activity window. I propose implementing B4 as a generic opt-in for a declared live presence view, with a supported opener, exact scoped read, bounded renewal, and expiry/leave behavior. Prove it with a real installation in the native kit witness and preserve signed package bytes. Please identify an authored open package if LV5 should also ship a user-facing live presence declaration in that package.","body":{"to":"planner"}}